   "turn": 1,
   "response_text": "Let me analyze the metrics:\n\n**Validation Accuracy Analysis:**\n- Range: 0.868347 to 0.882058\n- Mean (rough): ~0.8806\n- Healthy range: 0.8519\u20130.8607\n\nThe validation accuracy is significantly **ABOVE** the healthy range throughout the entire training. The lowest value is 0.8683, which is still well above the upper bound of the healthy range (0.8607).\n\n**Training Loss Analysis:**\n- Started at 0.326 and decreased to 0.261 by epoch 19\n- This shows healthy convergence\n\nThis is anomalous. Let me check the training logs to see if there are any errors or warnings that could explain this unusual performance.",
